name phfcc
category Package
revision 60731
shortdesc Convenient inline commenting in collaborative documents
longdesc Easily define helper macros to insert comments in a LaTeX
longdesc document. A convenient syntax enables you to mark text
longdesc additions (e.g., "... \phf{I'm adding this text} ..." or "...
longdesc \phf I'm adding this text\endphf ..."), an in-line comment
longdesc (e.g., "... We're the best \phf[I'm not sure about this.]
longdesc ..."), and text removals (e.g., "... \phf*{remove me} ...").
longdesc New colors are assigned automatically to each commenter by
longdesc default, and the appearance of all comments is highly
longdesc customizable.
